%% SC-03: 从 Skill 包导入
%% 流程图: import-from-package.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户选择 .zip 文件]) --> ValidateFile{验证文件}
    ValidateFile -->|非 .zip| ShowFormatError[显示错误<br/>无效的 Skill 包文件]
    ValidateFile -->|是 .zip| ExtractZIP[解压 .zip 文件]

    ShowFormatError --> End([结束])

    ExtractZIP --> CheckManifest{检查 skill-manifest.json}
    CheckManifest -->|不存在| ShowNoManifest[显示错误<br/>无效的包格式]
    CheckManifest -->|存在| ReadManifest[读取 skill-manifest.json]

    ShowNoManifest --> End

    ReadManifest --> ParseMetadata[解析包元数据]
    ParseMetadata --> ExtractFields[提取字段<br/>name, description, version, checksum]
    ExtractFields --> ValidateChecksum{验证完整性}
    ValidateChecksum --> CalcActualChecksum[计算实际 SHA-256]
    CalcActualChecksum --> CompareChecksum{对比校验和}
    CompareChecksum -->|不匹配| ShowCorrupted[显示错误<br/>Skill 包已损坏或被篡改]
    CompareChecksum -->|匹配| CheckSignature{验证签名?}
    CheckSignature -->|否| InstallSkill[安装 Skill]
    CheckSignature -->|是| VerifySignature[验证包签名]
    VerifySignature -->|失败| ShowSigWarning[显示警告<br/>包签名验证失败]
    VerifySignature -->|成功| InstallSkill

    ShowCorrupted --> End
    ShowSigWarning --> UserConfirm{用户确认?}
    UserConfirm -->|取消| End
    UserConfirm -->|继续| InstallSkill

    InstallSkill --> CopyFiles[复制 Skill 文件]
    CopyFiles --> SaveMetadata[保存包元数据]
    SaveMetadata --> RecordSource[记录包来源]
    RecordSource --> ShowSuccess[显示导入成功]
    ShowSuccess --> End([结束: 导入完成])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style ShowFormatError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowNoManifest fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowCorrupted fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowSigWarning fill:#fff3cd
    style ShowSuccess fill:#d1ecf1
